  <div class="container">
    <p class="section__eyebrow">02 · IDENTITY</p>
    <h2 class="section__title">Birmingham Producer</h2>
    <p class="section__body">
      Xalpheric is a Birmingham-based electronic music producer and co-founder of MidiMob Collective,
      bringing over 25 years of experience crafting downtempo psyhop, hip-hop, chillhop, and ambient
      soundscapes. His music blends jazz and blues influences with introspective beats, creating
      immersive sonic experiences that bridge genres and moods.
    </p>
    <p class="section__body" style="margin-top: 1.5rem;">
      Live rig: Roland SP-404 sampler, iPad with Koala Sampler, Yamaha MG10XU mixer, guitar.
      Vinyl sampling is central — dusty crate-digger identity alongside electronic dancefloor energy.
    </p>
    <div class="tape-block" style="margin-top: var(--space-block); max-width: 480px;">
